esents a shape consisting of one or more","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"polylines. For example, you could use a multipolyline shape to represent both","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sides of a divided highway (dual carriageway), excluding the median (central"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"reservation): each carriageway would be a distinct ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPolyline"},{"type":"text","text":" object."}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPolyline","title":"MLNMultiPolyline","kind":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNMapView/addAnnotations:":{"fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"addAnnotations:","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView\/addAnnotations:","title":"addAnnotations:","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmapview\/addannotations:","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Adds an array of annotations to the map view."}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic"}}}